      "location": "答29(b)首个行间空隙，两处",
      "original": "i_2-i_1+1",
      "final": "$(i_2-i_1-1)+2(i_3-i_2-1)",
      "basis": "相邻选中行之间有i₂−i₁−1个未选行。连续取1、2时为零，旧式得2。文字与紧随指数两处同步，有限逐集合计算通过。",
      "isAuthorOfficialErratum": false,
      "isProjectMathematicalCorrection": true,
      "cnPrintedPage": 645,
      "pageMarkdownSha256": "1a8bceb5f30417aea1e9c7def923b6283e08187119bba70d36b7d42724bd51b4"
    },
    {
      "id": "volume4a-tail-answer-035",
      "section": "7.2.1.5",
      "cnPdfPage": 660,
      "enPdfPages": [
        786
      ],
      "location": "答29(c)附加生成式的因子、指数及上界",
      "original": "\\sum_{t\\ge0}z^t\\prod_j(1-y^{a_j+m-j+t})/(1-y)=\\sum_{k=0}^n\\cdots",
      "final": "(1-z)\\sum_{t=0}^\\infty z^t\\prod_{j=1}^m\\frac{1-y^{a_j+j-m+t}}{1-y}",
      "basis": "由原习题(c)逐t式，指数是aⱼ+j−m+t，车数决定上限m。生成 t!_y/(t−k)!_y 得k!_y z^k/∏_{s=0}^k(1−y^s z)，故移s=0公因子到左边。取m=2,a=(0,0),t=1,y=1能区分旧指数的2与实际0；m=1,a=(1),y=2时原左z¹系数3，右为2，恰差z⁰系数1。当前右端上限一并取m。对207组有限行形/y逐个核z⁰…z⁵；文献归属按原书抄录。",
      "isAuthorOfficialErratum": false,
      "isProjectMathematicalCorrection": true,
      "cnPrintedPage": 645,
      "pageMarkdownSha256": "1a8bceb5f30417aea1e9c7def923b6283e08187119bba70d36b7d42724bd51b4"
    },
    {
      "id": "volume4a-tail-answer-036",
      "section": "7.2.1.5",
      "cnPdfPage": 660,
      "enPdfPages": [
        786
      ],
      "location": "答29(c)剩余的k行",
      "original": "将k个车放到k个未用列的小于等于t的列",
      "final": "用其余 $k$ 行在编号至多为 $t$ 的列内放置 $k$ 个车",
      "basis": "EN为k unused rows。原先m−k个车已在不同的行，待填的是余下行，列需位于新增的t列。",
      "isAuthorOfficialErratum": false,
      "cnPrintedPage": 645,
