      ],
      "location": "答40系数的首个斯特林修正",
      "original": "1+n/12+O(n^{-2})",
      "final": "1-\\frac{1}{12n}+O(n^{-2})",
      "basis": "题给精确系数c^(n−1)/(n−1)!，倒数斯特林展开首项为−1/(12n)。在c=2、n=64/256/1024复算n倍相对差，接近−1/12。",
      "isAuthorOfficialErratum": false,
      "isProjectMathematicalCorrection": true,
      "cnPrintedPage": 647,
