    {
      "id": "volume4a-tail-answer-046",
      "section": "7.2.1.5",
      "cnPdfPage": 664,
      "enPdfPages": [
        791
      ],
      "location": "答51负鞍点的相对指数尺度",
      "original": "e^{-\\sqrt n}",
      "final": "e^{-2\\sqrt n}",
      "basis": "σ’=−1−σ。两个鞍点的实指数模之对数差为−σ−1/2−(n+1)ln(1+1/σ)=−2√n+O(n^−1/2)，而高斯宽度之比趋1。保留小n仍可能显著的原注。",
      "isAuthorOfficialErratum": false,
      "isProjectMathematicalCorrection": true,
      "cnPrintedPage": 649,
      "pageMarkdownSha256": "eaff2fd5f84f66665486c09bb2592649ab4ea8cee7e8c8cd058599d4e0480cd0"
    },
    {
      "id": "volume4a-tail-answer-047",
      "section": "7.2.1.5",
      "cnPdfPage": 664,
      "enPdfPages": [
        791
      ],
      "location": "答51主鞍点因子指数",
      "original": "e^{(n+\\sigma)/2}",
      "final": "e^{(n+1+\\sigma)/2}",
      "basis": "σ²+σ=n+1，故σ+σ²/2=(n+1+σ)/2。原因子漏e^(1/2)，n=64/256/1024的对合精确数也核对了对应的主因子与b₁乘积。",
      "isAuthorOfficialErratum": false,
      "isProjectMathematicalCorrection": true,
      "cnPrintedPage": 649,
      "pageMarkdownSha256": "eaff2fd5f84f66665486c09bb2592649ab4ea8cee7e8c8cd058599d4e0480cd0"
    },
    {
      "id": "volume4a-tail-answer-048",
      "section": "7.2.1.5",
      "cnPdfPage": 664,
      "enPdfPages": [
        791
      ],
      "location": "答52(a)累积量中的斯特林指标",
      "original": "\\bigl\\{{k\\atop j}\\bigr\\}",
      "final": "\\kappa_j&=e^\\xi\\sum_k\\begin{Bmatrix}j\\\\k\\end{Bmatrix}",
      "basis": "j次系数来自(e^t−1)^k/k!，应为S(j,k)。例如精确κ₁=ξe^ξ。三组有理ξ的1–6阶系数复算。",
      "isAuthorOfficialErratum": false,
      "isProjectMathematicalCorrection": true,
      "cnPrintedPage": 649,
      "pageMarkdownSha256": "eaff2fd5f84f66665486c09bb2592649ab4ea8cee7e8c8cd058599d4e0480cd0"
    },
    {
