      "cnPdfPage": 664,
      "enPdfPages": [
        791
      ],
      "location": "答52(b)累积量下标",
      "original": "\\kappa=j=\\varpi_j",
      "final": "\\kappa_j=\\varpi_j[j\\ne0]",
      "basis": "原打印出等号，所指第j个累积量，第一段已定义κⱼ。由(b)的G(z)求lnG(e^t)=exp(exp(t)−1)−1，系数为Bellⱼ。",
      "isAuthorOfficialErratum": false,
      "isProjectMathematicalCorrection": true,
      "cnPrintedPage": 649,
      "pageMarkdownSha256": "eaff2fd5f84f66665486c09bb2592649ab4ea8cee7e8c8cd058599d4e0480cd0"
    },
    {
      "id": "volume4a-tail-answer-050",
