      "cnPdfPage": 664,
      "enPdfPages": [
        791
      ],
      "location": "答52(a)产生e倍贝尔数的参数条件",
      "original": "\\xi e^\\xi=1\\text{，则 }\\kappa_j=e\\varpi",
      "final": "$\\xi=1$，则 $\\kappa_j=e\\varpi_j[j\\ne0]$",
      "basis": "正确系数式取ξ=1才给全部Bellⱼ乘e。原条件ξe^ξ=1意味着κ₁=1而非e。下文取ξe^ξ=n的均值和方差原条件保持，概率分母括号完整呈现。",
      "isAuthorOfficialErratum": false,
      "isProjectMathematicalCorrection": true,
